      { id: "dev_genetic", t: "Known genetic syndrome (for example fragile X, 22q11.2 deletion, neurofibromatosis type 1)", flag: "adhd", ddx: "idd", note: "Several genetic syndromes carry high rates of ADHD. Check intellectual ability and other needs (clinical practice)." }
